# Context filter for `docker build -f cav21ae_rel/Dockerfile .`, read by BuildKit
# in preference to the repository's root `.dockerignore`, which it REPLACES
# rather than extends -- so this file repeats the root's entries and leaves out
# only `cav21ae_rel` itself, whose `exp.sh` the README tells the reader to run.
# Without it the root file removes that directory from the context and the image
# is built without the experiment script; the build succeeds anyway, which is how
# the same mistake went unnoticed for a year in two other packages.  Requires
# BuildKit (the default since Docker 23.0).

.git
_build
.vscode

cav21ae_dt
popl24ae
icfp24ae
oopsla25ae
pldi26ae_lower
pldi26ae_omega
cav26ae
script/starexec
learner
script
